  "title": "extcap: Do not hang if extcap doesn't open fifo",
  "description": "Simply open and close the fifo as part of cleanup. Doing so lets dumpcap\nknow that the capture has finished if extcap did not open the pipe. This\nis only needed on *NIX systems, because there was no hang on Windows.\n\nFixes #18715",
